     N'A share of end-of-service benefits is debt: owed to staff, paid in cash and not funded by dedicated assets.'),
    ('RECLASS', 'ADJ_RELATED_DEBT', N'المستحق لأطراف ذات علاقة دين قصير', N'Due to related parties is short-term debt',
